{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36580","headline":"春日叶秀才曲江 · 罗隐","name":"春日叶秀才曲江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江花江草暖相隈，也向江边把酒杯。\n春色恼人遮不得，别愁如疟避还来。\n安排贱迹无良策，裨补明时望重才。\n一曲吴歌齐拍手，十年尘眼未曾开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}